{"id":"2971a6afd81dd3d9","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-forcing-evaluation-map.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Evaluation Map","display":"df-zfc-forcing-evaluation-map — ZFC Forcing Evaluation Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-evaluation-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-evaluation-map"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-evaluation-map — ZFC Forcing Evaluation Map","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]","[[58-df-name]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-evaluation-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-evaluation-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-evaluation-map — ZFC Forcing Evaluation Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"58-df-name\">58-df-name</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (forcing poset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq P\">\\(G\\subseteq P\\)</span> (filter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> (candidate class graph of name evaluation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\)</span> (forcing-name predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"58-df-name\">58-df-name</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S\\)</span> (well-founded name evaluation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ForcingEvaluationMap}\">\\(\\operatorname{ForcingEvaluationMap}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}evaluation\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\operatorname{ForcingEvaluationMap}(E,G,P)\\leftrightarrow G\\subseteq P\\land\\forall\\tau\\;\\forall x\\;\\bigl(\\langle\\tau,x\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Name}(\\tau,P)\\land\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}evaluation\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\operatorname{ForcingEvaluationMap}(E,G,P)\\leftrightarrow G\\subseteq P\\land\\forall\\tau\\;\\forall x\\;\\bigl(\\langle\\tau,x\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Name}(\\tau,P)\\land\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The recursive clause and uniqueness are supplied by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a>. The result is expressed as a class graph because the collection of all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-names is not a set-sized domain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md","status":"resolved","id":"0c40d420e5118724","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-name","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-name]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-name","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Name}$ (forcing-name predicate, see [[58-df-name]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md","status":"resolved","id":"0c40d420e5118724","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S$ (well-founded name evaluation, see [[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md","status":"resolved","id":"0c40d420e5118724","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The recursive clause and uniqueness are supplied by [[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]. The result is expressed as a class graph because the collection of all $P$-names is not a set-sized domain.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"G\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Name}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ForcingEvaluationMap}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}evaluation\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\operatorname{ForcingEvaluationMap}(E,G,P)\\leftrightarrow G\\subseteq P\\land\\forall\\tau\\;\\forall x\\;\\bigl(\\langle\\tau,x\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Name}(\\tau,P)\\land\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":1237,"backli